'''Divan's Alloy''' is a {{Legendary}} material used in forging the {{Item|Divan's Drill}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Divan's Alloy''' has a {{Chance|0.005463%|1|18,306.6|rolls}} chance of appearing in a [[Crystal Nucleus Bundle]]. This equals a base chance of approximately {{Chance|0.090131%|1|1,109.5|bundles}} per bundle. This chance can be increased by the {{aqua|High Roller}} [[Diamond Essence Shop]] perk, the {{Attr|Bigger Box}} ({{Item|Hideoncave Shard}}) attribute, and the {{Item|Mole Pet}}'s {{AN|Nucleic Explorer}} perk, for a final chance of {{Chance|0.104607%|1|956.0|bundles}}.

It is guaranteed to drop after [[Pity and RNG Meters#Crystal_Nucleus_RNG_Meter|{{Blue|1,000,000 Crystal Nucleus XP}}]] (accessible via {{Code|/hotm}} or {{Code|/rng}}), which equals {{Green|1,000}} Nucleus Runs (or {{Green|910}} with {{Attr|Pity X}} ({{Item|Daemon Shard}})).

'''Divan&#39;s Alloy''' can also be obtained as a {{Red|'''MAJOR'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

